OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police defends drill rap use
OL,4,Ain court trials
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Metropolitan Police has defended
OL,7,Fthe use of drill music lyrics as
OL,8,Fevidence in criminal cases following a
OL,9,Fcampaign to change the law to restrict
OL,10,Ftheir use.
OL,12,FDrill rap videos and lyrics have been
OL,13,Fused as evidence in recent murder
OL,14,Ftrials, and police have alleged that
OL,15,Fsome of the music showed rappers
OL,16,Fboasting about real-life violent
OL,17,Fbehaviour.
OL,19,FA report by the Centre on the Dynamics
OL,20,Fof Ethnicity said drill rap lyrics were
OL,21,Fused as evidence against 252 defendants
OL,22,Fbetween 2020 and 2023.
OL,23,APub: 27-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
