OL,3,GNEWSAMet Police defends drill rap use
OL,4,Ain court trials
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaign group Art Not Evidence, which
OL,7,Fincludes lawyers and academics, is
OL,8,Flobbying the government to change the
OL,9,Flaw to create an assumption that
OL,10,F"creative expression" is not admissible
OL,11,Fevidence.
